    {
      "id": "claim_abe3f93d49314a3593b52fcdfcbc6d38",
      "statement": "The nine varietal families map Typica/Kona/JBM/Mocha/Kent to typica; Bourbon/Caturra/Catuai/Pacas/Villa Sarchi/Tekisic/Mundo Novo/Santos to bourbon; Ethiopian landraces, Pink Bourbon, Bourbon Ají, Wush Wush, Chiroso and generic wild/native/landrace terms to heirloom; Geisha/Gesha to geisha; SL28/SL34 and other Scott Labs selections to sl_varieties; Catimor/Castillo/Colombia/Ruiru 11/Batian/Tabi/Sidra/F1 and similar to hybrid; Pacamara/Maragogype to large_bean; with arabica_other and other as catch-alls.",
