      "statement": "The CLI `kissaten categorize varietals` command runs the categoriser with options --review-and-merge, --retry/--no-retry (threshold 0.6), --skip-validation, and --database-path, and runs the post-categorisation validation gate unless --skip-validation is set; `kissaten validate-mappings [--allow-redundant]` is the strict CI check that exits non-zero on any duplicate.",
